# Power BI Dashboard Screenshots

This folder contains screenshots of the four-page Power BI dashboard developed for the synthetic A/B testing checkout experiment.

## 1. Experiment Overview
Introduces the business problem, experiment hypothesis, test design and control versus treatment checkout experience.

## 2. Experiment Outcomes
Compares conversion rates between the control and treatment groups and presents the statistical evidence used to interpret the results.

## 3. Commercial Impact
Explores revenue per session and illustrative monthly gross revenue scenarios under different conversion-rate assumptions.

## 4. Decision & Limitations
Summarises the recommended next steps, sample-size considerations, business success criteria and limitations of the experiment.

## Important Note
This is an Amazon-inspired portfolio case study using synthetic data. It does not contain actual Amazon customer data or represent Amazon's real business performance.
